# Pre-launch holding page.
#
# Everything except the asset folder renders maintenance.html, with the URL
# left as the visitor typed it (200 = rewrite, not redirect). The "!" forces
# the rule even though index.html and the other pages really exist.
#
# TO LAUNCH THE SITE: delete this file. That is the whole switch.

/assets/*   /assets/:splat       200
/*          /maintenance.html    200!
